        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Isolation of Burkholderia pseudomallei from clinical specimens plus compatible clinical syndrome",
    "notes": "Serology and imaging support diagnosis but culture confirmation is gold standard"
